  "description": "A 40-minute dumbbell strength session from Heather Robertson, ~2M views. Four circuits of four moves at 40 seconds work and 20 seconds rest, each circuit done twice back to back: squats, deadlifts and push presses first, then lunges, bridges and skull crushers, then Cossack squats, swings and rear flys, finishing with renegade rows. She uses 10, 15 and 25 lb dumbbells.",
